\"20f4dd95-70c7-707b-84a2-7655261b6e2a\", \"cf7d310a-6de0-74c7-ad07-376e2611955f\"],\n      \"estimatedSeconds\": 40\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"concept\",\n      \"title\": \"Two Manifestations of Righteousness\",\n      \"description\": \"Explain the twin manifestations every believer carries: righteousness as a gift—positional, received by grace through faith apart from works (Galatians 3:6, Romans 4), a fixed legal credit that cannot increase or diminish—and the harvest of righteous","ness (2 Corinthians 9:10), which is dynamic, agricultural, and meant to be multiplied through visible works.\",\n      \"objectiveIds\": [\"01a0e763-298d-72ff-acc0-5c66a90b0b5e\"],\n      \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"64d91fd4-fd5f-7fe8-adb7-0f9fe209531d\", \"98598b3c-b464-739b-a5a1-66ccd8096d65\"],\n      \"estimatedSeconds\": 40\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"analogy\",\n      \"title\": \"The David Analogy: Who Is Asking?\",\n      \"description\": \"Use the David-and-Goliath analogy to make the distinction memorable: before Goliath, David stood on covenant faith; before King Saul, he pointed to visible evidence—the lion and the bear. Before God we present only faith and Christ's finished work; before people there must be a visible harvest of works.\",\n      \"objectiveIds\": [\"01a0e763-298d-72ff-acc0-5c66a90b0b5e\"],\n      \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"7ca0a956-373a-7896-8a32-456f0344144c\"],\n      \"estimatedSeconds\": 30\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"concept\",\n      \"title\": \"Generosity as Overflow, and the Word Tzedakah\",\n      \"description\": \"Show how 2 Corinthians 9 ties righteousness to generosity: true giving is a willing, cheerful overflow, not reluctant compulsion—'sowing sparingly' describes the heart, not just the amount. Then introduce the Hebrew word Tzedakah, which unifies personal morality, justice, and charity into one whole—giving to the poor is classified as justice, not optional benevolence.\",\n      \"objectiveIds\": [\"01a0e763-298d-72db-a097-c524db3c95c3\"],\n      \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"3097b16a-81ed-7e14-bbd1-4372ac5d2a9f\", \"404cff6f-4c0d-7875-aabb-96f0685d45bf\", \"55e6a00a-7daf-7653-9764-58b09c2faf5c\", \"bdc0807c-979f-71d3-996e-9d27a215a842\", \"ec9b23ad-0dca-7100-bce3-f16c42945ec8\"],\n      \"estimatedSeconds\": 40\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"example\",\n      \"title\": \"Kingdom Economics in Practice\",\n      \"description\": \"Walk through the consecrated financial structures that contradict self-serving worldly models: returning a debtor's cloak before sundown (fairness over legal rights), the seven-year debt c","ancellation cycle, leaving gleanings at field edges for the poor, prompt payment of workers, and refusing to exploit another's desperation for a bargain.\",\n      \"objectiveIds\": [\"01a0e763-298d-746d-bbe5-2e6330d3a67e\"],\n      \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"42f96242-5b50-77b4-8fd1-30435834ce62\", \"f652082f-4c61-7679-b7d2-27068503afdb\", \"44ce8e2d-3a2d-777b-a799-cba92010fa0e\", \"36d4fba2-2fdd-71d4-bfb0-939d0f3f07cb\", \"872dd57d-4efe-7581-a110-756d73a46531\", \"69bd5311-e0ef-7811-972d-636ddf04576f\"],\n      \"estimatedSeconds\": 40\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"concept\",\n      \"title\": \"Power Produces the Miracle; Wisdom Sustains It\",\n      \"description\": \"Analyze why divine power must be paired with divine wisdom: Jethro's critique of Moses shows that raw power without structure leads to burnout; the Mark 5 resurrection protocol—Jesus ordering food for the raised girl—shows power restores but wisdom keeps alive. Add the two stewardship truths: God gives the power to get wealth (Deuteronomy 8:18), making us managers not owners, and He demands accountability, as the Parable of the Talents illustrates.\",\n      \"objectiveIds\": [\"01a0e763-298d-7c24-8d8c-02cf104d90c5\"],\n      \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"41b9c1a2-cec3-77bc-b26c-81c618410943\", \"702499e4-83e0-7303-8531-e912d1797a5a\", \"d2b8afef-14c7-762a-b8dd-bed047765d37\", \"c705e30a-effc-72e7-ae8b-ea6561e3dd05\", \"56da342f-cd42-7d37-b7b6-b768bb0be721\", \"110b3fc0-2a5e-77ec-bf76-a9b7eefe2cfc\"],\n      \"estimatedSeconds\": 40\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"concept\",\n      \"title\": \"The Five Pillars of Financial Faithfulness\",\n      \"description\": \"Apply the operational framework for maintaining wealth: budgeting and tracking with the 50/30/20 rule (needs, wants, savings/investment), protection through health insurance, vehicle insurance, and a 3–6 month emergency fund, savings that gather like the ant for future opportunities, investment preceded by knowledge and due diligence, and debt management with a clear payback plan—since the borrower is servant to the lende","r.\",\n      \"objectiveIds\": [\"01a0e763-298d-75f6-a47a-602c43cf0d3d\"],\n      \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"4815b8fc-21a8-7fa7-8917-c12836453d01\", \"caedb0b5-51ce-7f62-97c4-1e4474d7719b\", \"8449a61b-2d1e-76ed-be02-541cc56685d0\", \"50bd8db7-41bd-7913-8a90-90a7aced7a8a\", \"22956c78-3a4a-7258-bb87-a6fb9df00ff3\", \"8f05cfb9-f4ee-78c4-991b-46b76bd198ea\", \"1af98d1e-c861-7054-82c0-a77a3a35b7af\", \"4f3fd2ef-56e4-7524-95e3-36c4a0df3406\", \"58cdc1bb-5be1-7589-b504-3dbaf2dd72d3\", \"07b68fb5-f47f-7e7a-b83e-9edc8f0616d2\", \"f7a0dee0-73dd-7342-811e-39c6595c7e54\", \"7f04f8d6-c813-7458-b704-27ca5825cd30\", \"16dd3981-b8c6-7944-9679-ceab8d99a408\"],\n      \"estimatedSeconds\": 40\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"summary\",\n      \"title\": \"Durable Riches, Maintained\",\n      \"description\": \"Close by tying the threads together: enduring riches flow along the path of righteousness—received as a gift, demonstrated as a harvest, expressed through Tzedakah generosity and Kingdom economic structures—and they are maintained when God's power is matched with wisdom, stewardship, and the five practical pillars of budgeting, protection, savings, investment, and debt management.\",\n      \"objectiveIds\": [\"01a0e763-298d-7c26-82ae-a5dad1bf59ac\", \"01a0e763-298d-72ff-acc0-5c66a90b0b5e\", \"01a0e763-298d-72db-a097-c524db3c95c3\", \"01a0e763-298d-746d-bbe5-2e6330d3a67e\", \"01a0e763-298d-7c24-8d8c-02cf104d90c5\", \"01a0e763-298d-75f6-a47a-602c43cf0d3d\"],\n      \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"cf7d310a-6de0-74c7-ad07-376e2611955f\", \"702499e4-83e0-7303-8531-e912d1797a5a\", \"4815b8fc-21a8-7fa7-8917-c12836453d01\"],\n      \"estimatedSeconds\": 30\n    }\n  ]\n}"],"textChunksTruncated":false,"textCharacters":7585,"reasoningCharacters":0,"finishReason":"stop","inputTokens":"[REDACTED]","outputTokens":"[REDACTED]"},"retries":0,"latencyMs":22694,"service":"pipeline-worker","correlationId":"01a0e75e-88f5-767d-995d-992f5f3a4ce4"}}
