{"timestamp":"2026-09-28T09:44:50.590Z","level":"info","event":"provider.together.response","fields":{"provider":"together","endpoint":"/chat/completions","response":{"httpStatus":200,"contentType":"text/event-stream","providerRequestId":"a95812b1-aws_ew1","model":"moonshotai/Kimi-K3","text":"{\n  \"schemaVersion\": \"narration-v1\",\n  \"targetDurationSeconds\": 300,\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0e765-16c7-7424-9e82-0abf7a917a11\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Have you ever seen someone get a big financial breakthrough, only to lose it all within a year?\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"illustration\",\n            \"rationale\": \"Opens with a relatable question to hook the listener, as the outline directs.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"This lesson draws on two sermons from Celebration Church International: 'Durable Riches and Righteousness' and 'Managing Personal Resources.'\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"20f4dd95-70c7-707b-84a2-7655261b6e2a\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Together they pair spiritual consecration with practical financial wisdom, showing not only how lasting wealth comes, but how it is kept.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"20f4dd95-70c7-707b-84a2-7655261b6e2a\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0e765-16c7-7ed9-a4fe-f24ac7ee6b3b\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Here is the series' core claim: spiritual consecration and financial principles belong together, not apart.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"20f4dd95-70c7-707b-84a2-7655261b6e2a\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Proverbs 8 records wisdom declaring that enduring riches and righteousness travel side by side.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"cf7d310a-6de0-74c7-ad07-376e2611955f\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Wisdom says she walks along the way of righteousness, right through the paths of justice.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"cf7d310a-6de0-74c7-ad07-376e2611955f\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Her goal is to cause those who love her to inherit wealth and to fill their treasuries.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"cf7d310a-6de0-74c7-ad07-376e2611955f\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"So in Scri","textChunks":["{\n  \"schemaVersion\": \"narration-v1\",\n  \"targetDurationSeconds\": 300,\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0e765-16c7-7424-9e82-0abf7a917a11\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Have you ever seen someone get a big financial breakthrough, only to lose it all within a year?\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"illustration\",\n            \"rationale\": \"Opens with a relatable question to hook the listener, as the outline directs.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"This lesson draws on two sermons from Celebration Church International: 'Durable Riches and Righteousness' and 'Managing Personal Resources.'\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"20f4dd95-70c7-707b-84a2-7655261b6e2a\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Together they pair spiritual consecration with practical financial wisdom, showing not only how lasting wealth comes, but how it is kept.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"20f4dd95-70c7-707b-84a2-7655261b6e2a\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0e765-16c7-7ed9-a4fe-f24ac7ee6b3b\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Here is the series' core claim: spiritual consecration and financial principles belong together, not apart.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"20f4dd95-70c7-707b-84a2-7655261b6e2a\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Proverbs 8 records wisdom declaring that enduring riches and righteousness travel side by side.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"cf7d310a-6de0-74c7-ad07-376e2611955f\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Wisdom says she walks along the way of righteousness, right through the paths of justice.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"cf7d310a-6de0-74c7-ad07-376e2611955f\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Her goal is to cause those who love her to inherit wealth and to fill their treasuries.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"cf7d310a-6de0-74c7-ad07-376e2611955f\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"So in Scri","pture, durable wealth is not random; it flows along a righteous track.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"cf7d310a-6de0-74c7-ad07-376e2611955f\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0e765-16c7-72b7-8b8b-9441d6aa9554\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"The teaching identifies two distinct manifestations of righteousness in every believer's life.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"64d91fd4-fd5f-7fe8-adb7-0f9fe209531d\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"First is righteousness as a gift, the legal foundation of salvation, received by grace through faith apart from works.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"64d91fd4-fd5f-7fe8-adb7-0f9fe209531d\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Galatians 3:6 and Romans 4 point to Abraham, who believed God and had it credited to him as righteousness.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"64d91fd4-fd5f-7fe8-adb7-0f9fe209531d\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"That credit is fixed and perfect; it cannot grow, shrink, or be multiplied.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"64d91fd4-fd5f-7fe8-adb7-0f9fe209531d\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Second is the harvest of righteousness, drawn from 2 Corinthians 9:10, where God multiplies seed and increases that harvest.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"64d91fd4-fd5f-7fe8-adb7-0f9fe209531d\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Unlike the gift, this harvest is dynamic and agricultural, and it is meant to increase through visible works.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"64d91fd4-fd5f-7fe8-adb7-0f9fe209531d\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0e765-16c7-781c-9aa5-a4e9164c6898\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"The David-and-Goliath story makes this distinction stick.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"7ca0a956-373a-7896-8a32-456f0344144c\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"How David answers depends on who is asking.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"7ca0a956-373a-7896-8a32-456f0344144c\"]\n        },\n        {\n       ","   \"text\": \"Facing Goliath, David stood on covenant: you dare defy the armies of the living God?\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"7ca0a956-373a-7896-8a32-456f0344144c\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Facing King Saul, he pointed to physical evidence: I have killed a lion and a bear.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"7ca0a956-373a-7896-8a32-456f0344144c\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"With God, faith and Christ's finished work are all we bring; with people, our faith must show up as deeds they can see.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"7ca0a956-373a-7896-8a32-456f0344144c\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0e765-16c7-77f4-b211-3581eaa65f17\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"In 2 Corinthians 9, Paul uses farming language to tie righteousness directly to financial generosity.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"3097b16a-81ed-7e14-bbd1-4372ac5d2a9f\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Real Christian giving is not a forced contribution; it is a willing overflow of spiritual righteousness.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"3097b16a-81ed-7e14-bbd1-4372ac5d2a9f\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Sowing sparingly describes the heart, not just the amount; it means giving reluctantly, without excitement or love.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"3097b16a-81ed-7e14-bbd1-4372ac5d2a9f\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"The Hebrew word Tzedakah pulls this together, treating morality, justice, and charity as one inseparable whole.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"404cff6f-4c0d-7875-aabb-96f0685d45bf\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"In the Hebrew scriptures, giving to the poor is classified as justice, not optional benevolence.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"ec9b23ad-0dca-7100-bce3-f16c42945ec8\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Withholding help when you have power to give actually violates Tzedakah.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"ec9b23ad-0dca-7100-bce3-f16c42945ec8\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n","      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0e765-16c7-768d-8169-0834f94dde9f\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Kingdom economics runs on laws that contradict ruthless, self-serving models of the world.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"42f96242-5b50-77b4-8fd1-30435834ce62\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"If you held a poor debtor's cloak as collateral, you returned it before sundown so he could sleep; fairness outranks legal rights.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"f652082f-4c61-7679-b7d2-27068503afdb\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Debts were canceled every seven years, and lenders were warned not to refuse help in the sixth year.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"44ce8e2d-3a2d-777b-a799-cba92010fa0e\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Farmers left field edges unharvested for the poor, the widow, and the stranger, building a safety net into profit.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"36d4fba2-2fdd-71d4-bfb0-939d0f3f07cb\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Workers were paid promptly, because withholding wages is a severe violation of righteousness.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"872dd57d-4efe-7581-a110-756d73a46531\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"And believers must never monetize another person's desperation to grab a bargain.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"69bd5311-e0ef-7811-972d-636ddf04576f\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0e765-16c7-7316-b443-821fd681c983\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Now, why does divine power need divine wisdom?\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"41b9c1a2-cec3-77bc-b26c-81c618410943\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Moses worked miracles, yet Jethro warned that judging all Israel alone would wear him out; raw power without structure leads to burnout.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"41b9c1a2-cec3-77bc-b26c-81c618410943\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Power produces the miracle; wisdom sustains it.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"702499e4-83e0-730","3-8531-e912d1797a5a\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"In Mark 5, right after Jesus raised Jairus's daughter, He commanded that she be given food; power restored her, but nourishment kept her alive.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"d2b8afef-14c7-762a-b8dd-bed047765d37\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Two stewardship truths follow: Deuteronomy 8:18 says God gives the power to get wealth, so we are managers, not owners.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"c705e30a-effc-72e7-ae8b-ea6561e3dd05\", \"56da342f-cd42-7d37-b7b6-b768bb0be721\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"And He demands accountability, as the Parable of the Talents shows, where the servant was condemned for making no interest.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"110b3fc0-2a5e-77ec-bf76-a9b7eefe2cfc\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0e765-16c7-7155-a887-59b1b4a849e2\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"The teaching organizes money management into five practical pillars.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"4815b8fc-21a8-7fa7-8917-c12836453d01\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"First, budgeting and tracking: a written plan, using the 50/30/20 rule for needs, wants, and savings or investment.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"caedb0b5-51ce-7f62-97c4-1e4474d7719b\", \"8449a61b-2d1e-76ed-be02-541cc56685d0\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Second, protection: health insurance, vehicle insurance, and an emergency fund covering three to six months of expenses.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"4f3fd2ef-56e4-7524-95e3-36c4a0df3406\", \"58cdc1bb-5be1-7589-b504-3dbaf2dd72d3\", \"07b68fb5-f47f-7e7a-b83e-9edc8f0616d2\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Third, savings: gather like the ant in harvest, so capital is ready when opportunities appear.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"f7a0dee0-73dd-7342-811e-39c6595c7e54\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Fourth, investment: invest in knowledge and due diligence before putting money into anything.\",\n          \"s","ourceBlockIds\": [\"7f04f8d6-c813-7458-b704-27ca5825cd30\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Fifth, debt management: keep a clear payback plan, because the borrower is servant to the lender.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"16dd3981-b8c6-7944-9679-ceab8d99a408\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0e765-16c7-7cc4-9239-445cb073dc7f\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Let's tie the threads together.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"clarification\",\n            \"rationale\": \"A brief transition signaling the summary, containing no factual claims.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Enduring riches travel the path of righteousness: received as a gift, demonstrated as a harvest, and expressed through Tzedakah generosity and Kingdom economic structures.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"cf7d310a-6de0-74c7-ad07-376e2611955f\", \"64d91fd4-fd5f-7fe8-adb7-0f9fe209531d\", \"404cff6f-4c0d-7875-aabb-96f0685d45bf\", \"42f96242-5b50-77b4-8fd1-30435834ce62\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"And they are maintained when God's power is matched with wisdom, stewardship, and the five pillars: budgeting, protection, savings, investment, and debt management.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"702499e4-83e0-7303-8531-e912d1797a5a\", \"4815b8fc-21a8-7fa7-8917-c12836453d01\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}"],"textChunksTruncated":false,"textCharacters":11405,"reasoningCharacters":0,"finishReason":"stop","inputTokens":"[REDACTED]","outputTokens":"[REDACTED]"},"retries":0,"latencyMs":32927,"service":"pipeline-worker","correlationId":"01a0e75e-88f5-767d-995d-992f5f3a4ce4"}}
